{# Jinja2 template for the batched "minor incidents" appendix.
   Rendered by ReportGenerator.generate_appendix() for incidents that did not
   qualify for an individual LLM investigation -- see
   LogAnalysisPipeline.is_minor_incident: pattern-only incidents (no
   corroborating correlated event) and correlated events below
   settings.investigation_min_confidence. Summarized here instead of as one
   full report each, so the report set stays focused and LLM calls stay
   practical. #}
# Appendix: Minor / Low-Confidence Incidents

- **Generated:** {{ generated_at }}
- **Incident count:** {{ incidents | length }}

These incidents did not meet the correlation-confidence bar for an individual AI-generated
investigation (either a single repeated-failure pattern with no corroborating correlated event, or a
correlated event below the configured confidence threshold). They are summarized briefly below rather
than as full reports.

{% for incident in incidents %}
## {{ incident.incident_id }} -- {{ incident.title }}

- Severity: {{ incident.severity.value }}
{% if incident.correlated_events %}
- Correlation confidence: {{ "%.2f" | format(incident.correlated_events[0].confidence_score) }}
- Components: {{ incident.correlated_events[0].involved_components | join(", ") }}
- Hosts: {{ incident.correlated_events[0].involved_hosts | join(", ") }}
{% else %}
- No corroborating correlated event (single repeated-failure pattern only)
{% endif %}
{% if incident.failure_patterns %}
{% set pattern_strs = [] %}
{% for p in incident.failure_patterns %}{% set _ = pattern_strs.append('"' ~ p.message ~ '" (' ~ p.occurrences ~ 'x)') %}{% endfor %}
- Failure pattern(s): {{ pattern_strs | join(", ") }}
{% endif %}
{% if incident.similar_incidents %}
- Closest historical incident: {{ incident.similar_incidents[0].incident.title }} (similarity: {{ "%.2f" | format(incident.similar_incidents[0].similarity_score) }})
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
